cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "biological-clock-of-multimorbidity"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline for "The biological clock of multimorbidity: temporal
  dynamics of disease co-occurrence in primary care" -- case-control
  matching, temporal-window relative-risk estimation with empirical Bayes
  shrinkage, and associated sensitivity analyses.
